WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.260
This is one page of a slow juicer manual.

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.621
Now, watch the same steps.

3
00:00:06.971 --> 00:00:10.084
Switch off and unplug the juicer.

4
00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:11.915
Turn the hopper counterclockwise,

5
00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:13.281
then lift it off.

6
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.003
Lift out the auger, the strainer,

7
00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:17.476
and the spinning brush.

8
00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:19.386
Then lift the chamber off the base.

9
00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:23.510
Turn the chamber over, and open the silicone plug.

10
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.129
Then brush every part under running water.

11
00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:29.121
Push the plug fully closed.

12
00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:32.666
If it stays open, juice leaks out under the chamber.

13
00:00:33.316 --> 00:00:35.441
Set the chamber on the base.

14
00:00:35.441 --> 00:00:37.925
Put in the brush, then the strainer.

15
00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:39.814
The two marks must meet.

16
00:00:40.964 --> 00:00:43.884
Press the auger down until it is fully seated.

17
00:00:43.884 --> 00:00:46.919
If it sits high, the hopper will not close.

18
00:00:47.569 --> 00:00:49.573
Set the hopper on.

19
00:00:49.573 --> 00:00:51.308
Turn it clockwise until it clicks,

20
00:00:51.308 --> 00:00:52.993
and the marks meet.

21
00:00:53.693 --> 00:00:57.010
Nothing left over, and no leak on the counter.
